{"id":525,"name":"boldore","speciesId":525,"dex":525,"form":"normal","generation":5,"types":["rock"],"stats":{"hp":70,"attack":105,"defense":105,"special-attack":50,"special-defense":40,"speed":20},"abilities":[{"name":"sturdy","hidden":false},{"name":"weak-armor","hidden":false},{"name":"sand-force","hidden":true}],"height":9,"weight":1020,"baseExp":137,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/525.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/525.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/525.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/525.ogg","genus":"Ore Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Minério","flavor":[{"version":"black","text":"When it overflows with power, the orange crystal on its body glows. It looks for underground water in caves."},{"version":"white","text":"Because its energy was too great to be contained, the energy leaked and formed orange crystals."},{"version":"black-2","text":"When it is healthy, its core sticks out. Always facing the same way, it swiftly moves front to back and left to right."},{"version":"sun","text":"Its orange crystal is a mass of energy. Just one crystal fragment would provide enough fuel for a hundred dump trucks."},{"version":"moon","text":"It explores caves in search of underground water. It’s not comfortable around water, so this Pokémon takes great care in lapping it up."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"The energy overflowing from its body has turned into orange crystals that are hard enough to smash diamonds."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its orange crystals are lumps of powerful energy. They’re valuable, so Boldore is sometimes targeted for them."},{"version":"sword","text":"If you see its orange crystals start to glow, be wary. It’s about to fire off bursts of energy."},{"version":"shield","text":"It relies on sound in order to monitor what’s in its vicinity. When angered, it will attack without ever changing the direction it’s facing."}],"flavorPt":"Ele depende do som para monitorar o que está nas proximidades. Quando irritado, ele atacará sem nunca mudar a direção para a qual está voltado.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":120,"eggGroups":["mineral"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"roggenrola","speciesId":524,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 25"],"species":"boldore","speciesId":525,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Troca"],"species":"gigalith","speciesId":526,"evolvesTo":[]}]}]},"varieties":[{"id":525,"name":"boldore","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/525.png"}],"games":[11,14,15,16,17,18,20],"moves":[{"id":28,"learn":[[11,"lv",1],[11,"lv",7],[14,"lv",1],[14,"lv",7],[15,"lv",1],[15,"lv",7],[16,"lv",1],[16,"lv",7],[17,"lv",1],[17,"lv",7],[18,"lv",1],[18,"lv",7],[20,"lv",1]]},{"id":29,"learn":[[11,"lv",1],[11,"lv",10],[14,"lv",1],[14,"lv",10],[15,"lv",1],[15,"lv",10],[16,"lv",1],[16,"lv",10],[17,"lv",1],[17,"lv",10],[18,"lv",1],[18,"lv",10],[20,"lv",24]]},{"id":33,"learn":[[11,"lv",1],[14,"lv",1],[15,"lv",1],[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[20,"lv",1]]},{"id":70,"learn":[[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0]]},{"id":89,"learn":[[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":92,"learn":[[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0]]},{"id":104,"learn":[[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0]]},{"id":106,"learn":[[11,"lv",1],[11,"lv",4],[14,"lv",1],[14,"lv",4],[15,"lv",1],[15,"lv",4],[16,"lv",1],[16,"lv",4],[17,"lv",1],[17,"lv",4],[18,"lv",1],[18,"lv",4],[20,"lv",1]]},{"id":153,"learn":[[11,"lv",55],[11,"tm",0],[14,"lv",55],[14,"tm",0],[15,"lv",55],[15,"tm",0],[16,"lv",55],[16,"tm",0],[17,"lv",55],[17,"tm",0],[18,"lv",55],[18,"tm